flowchart TD
    A[You ask for an invoice for a client] --> B[Kota pulls that client's context: pricing, tone, VAT status]
    B --> C[VAT and totals calculated from real data, not guessed]
    C --> D[Structured invoice draft prepared]
    D --> E{Review the draft}
    E -->|Needs changes| D
    E -->|Looks right| F[Send it]
    F --> G[Tracked automatically: due date, payment status, follow-ups]
